      },
      "why": "PREDICTED BEFORE SCORING. `boxed.js` declares its own `var module`, so `module.exports = { find }` (bare, and in `var api = \u2026`) writes onto a local and the real module exports `{}`: `boxed.find` is `undefined`."
    },
