      "edge": {
        "src": "ts:client.go",
        "dst": "ts:boxed.list",
        "kind": "CALLS"
      },
      "why": "PREDICTED BEFORE SCORING. `module.exports.list = list` in `boxed.js` writes onto its own `var module`'s object, not the real exports."
    },
    {
